Creator: Minh
1. What this website is: This website emulates the popular chatbot interfaces (ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, ...). It should support text based chat, we don't need image gen or other modality yet.
2. How it uses the data files in data: For this website, we will not have any data. However it should route to a cheap gpt model in the backend via api. Implement a very rudimentary RAG system to emulate the ChatBot system instead of just talking to an API end point. Here the data might be prompts that you created.
3. What real world websites it should be modeled after: ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, ...
4. Whether the domain has temporal/dynamic data (and how it should simulate): this domain is relatively dynamic in nature. Within a sim session, it should have memory of conversation with the user.
5. Any domain-specific behavior or constraints: N/A